": "toolu_012FaZ6grF197zeTJUjat7ad", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52684, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012FaZ6grF197zeTJUjat7ad", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 53887, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0154Wn9DGnVp2x5WJcu7f5W3", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54187, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0154Wn9DGnVp2x5WJcu7f5W3", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54187, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0154Wn9DGnVp2x5WJcu7f5W3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58187, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **Before:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. Both v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy, so v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release.\n2. **Rollback:** the first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which briefly left the regions on different versions. I retried and it finished. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** the request to open it timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created, so I didn't retry, which would have paged on-call twice. The incident covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current status and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01F3uWCC3hPNqYacBQk1a8eq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014mYK4SeHDHhUQsowgoeW3M", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015AHjJoYBQehzw6DiHwQtjk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015Rwep5deBq1s3dVxyPedAw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LmhbDrySMGhpLjsF8gm3Bc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VEZh3kbGEx5msFTBHYo1Ea", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018rULWbTjV4mY3SBaBQkbMG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012FaZ6grF197zeTJUjat7ad", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release marked healthy (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy). The first rollback attempt partially failed: an orchestrator error stopped it after us-east, leaving the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback, and all regions are now on v2.3.0. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0154Wn9DGnVp2x5WJcu7f5W3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **Before:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%. Both v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) were marked unhealthy, so v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release.\n2. **Rollback:** the first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which briefly left the regions on different versions. I retried and it finished. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** the request to open it timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created, so I didn't retry, which would have paged on-call twice. The incident covers the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current status and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}